            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Shruti 1.4.25 — your level from the first sound

- An app you have set to a lower level (or muted, or given an effect) now plays at that level from its very first sound. Before, it started at full volume and dropped to your setting a second later, which sounded like Shruti ducking it.
- Apps at their untouched default are unchanged: still the zero-cost direct path.
]]></description>
